# `engine.toml`: every key the reader knows, taken from `KNOWN_KEYS` in
# `src/import/settings.rs`, and the table headers the layering hangs off.
#
# A key one character out is the case the reader is built around — it warns and
# suggests a correction rather than applying a value silently — so the near
# misses are worth as much here as the hits.

